* {{ill|Mononobe no Emaro|ja|物部兄麻呂}}
* {{ill|Musashi no Take Shiba|ja|武蔵武芝}}
}}

== Headquarters ==
Primary regions include:
* '''Musashi Province''': Later divided into modern Tokyo, Saitama, and Kanagawa areas.
* '''Mound complexes''': Archaeological evidence suggests their burials were in locations like {{ill|Saitama Kofun Cluster|ja|埼玉古墳群}}.

=== Associated Deities ===
* '''{{ill|Ōkunitama Shrine|ja|大國魂神社}}'''
* '''{{ill|Hikawa Shrine|ja|氷川神社}}'''

