* '''牟邪志国造''' - Found in "Kuni no Miyatsuko Chronicle" in various manuscript copies.

=== Founding Ancestors ===
* According to the {{ill|Kojiki|en|Kojiki|qid=Q813031|lt=Kojiki|1=Kojiki}}, the clan descended from {{ill|Ame no Hohinomi no Mikoto|ja|天之菩卑能命|1=Ame no Hohi|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ame no Hohinomi no Mikoto|13=User:Immanuelle/Ame no Hohi|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to アメノホヒ}}, with his son {{ill|Takehiranome|ja|建比良鳥命|1=Takehi-Nateru|1=Takehi-Nateru|zh|建比良鳥命|1=Takehi-Nateru|fr|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Takehiranome|13=User:Immanuelle/Takehi-Nateru|qq=}} founding Muzashi no Kuni no Miyatsuko.
* The {{ill|Nihon Shoki|en|Nihon Shoki|qid=Q813935|lt=Nihon Shoki|1=Nihon Shoki}} attributes the lineage to {{ill|Ama-no-Hohohi-no-Mikoto|ja|天穂日命|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ama-no-Hohohi-no-Mikoto|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to アメノホヒ|1=Ame no Hohi|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q10940685}}.
* The {{ill|Takahashi Ujibumi|en|Takahashi Ujibumi|qid=Q1108567|lt=Takahashi Monjo|1=Takahashi Ujibumi}} recounts that {{ill|Ōtamahibi|ja|大多毛比|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōtamahibi|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, who served Emperor {{ill|Emperor Keikō|en|Emperor Keikō|qid=Q329723|lt=Keikō|1=Emperor Keikō}}, was the clan's progenitor.

=== Clan ===
The Muzashi no Kuni no Miyatsuko descended from the {{ill|Musashi clan|ja|武蔵氏|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Musashi clan|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} and shared connections with the {{ill|Izumo clan|ja|出雲氏|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izumo clan|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 出雲国造}}. The following branches are linked:
* {{ill|Kasahara clan|ja|笠原氏|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kasahara clan|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 无邪志国造|1=Musashi no Kuni no Miyatsuko|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q11504612}}
* {{ill|Osakabe clan|ja|刑部氏|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Osakabe clan|1=Q11396372|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q11396372}}
* {{ill|Hasetsukabe clan|ja|丈部氏|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hasetsukabe clan|1=hasetsukabeuji|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q55530004}}

