== Headquarters ==
Primary regions include:
* '''Musashi Province''': Later divided into modern Tokyo, Saitama, and Kanagawa areas.
* '''Mound complexes''': Archaeological evidence suggests their burials were in locations like {{ill|Sakitama Kofun Cluster|en|Sakitama Kofun Cluster|qid=Q2213580|lt=Saitama Kofun Cluster|1=Sakitama Kofun Cluster}}.

=== Associated Deities ===
