* '''{{ill|Hikawa Shrine (Saitama)|en|Hikawa Shrine (Saitama)|qid=Q703633|lt=Hikawa Shrine|1=Hikawa Shrine (Saitama)}}'''

== Descendants ==
Their legacy is seen in ancient inscriptions found in tombs and family lineages continuing into the Edo Period.

